  curator: salt-hydrate-identity-fix
  action: CORRECTED
  changes: 'Re-grounded CHEBI:64243 ''monosodium L-glutamate'' -> CHEBI:232425 ''monosodium
    L-glutamate hydrate'' (EXACT_MATCH). The record is the monohydrate: its cas_rn
    6106-04-3 was set by an independent PubChem name lookup on ''Sodium glutamate
    monohydrate'', and CHEBI:232425 ''monosodium L-glutamate hydrate'' (formula C5H8NO4.H2O.Na)
    is the matching term. It was on CHEBI:64243 (anhydrous, ChEBI CAS xref 142-47-2)
    only because the specific term was never found. Monohydrate 187.13 vs anhydrous
    169.11 g/mol is a 10.6% weigh-out difference across the 11 media using it.'
  previous_status: MAPPED
  new_status: MAPPED
  llm_assisted: true
